Port of fixup/10/profile/perf/28_elide_redundant_sext_riscv64 to .NET 11.
genCodeForCompare/genCodeForJumpCompare no longer sign-extend 32-bit
operands in .NET 11, so only the emitter peephole, the lowering cast
elision and the genRangeCheck part are carried over.

diff --git a/src/coreclr/jit/codegenriscv64.cpp b/src/coreclr/jit/codegenriscv64.cpp
--- a/src/coreclr/jit/codegenriscv64.cpp
+++ b/src/coreclr/jit/codegenriscv64.cpp
@@ -3061,6 +3061,52 @@
